Package: rglyos
Title: Color Palettes Inspired by Glyos Colorways
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Brian", "Maitner", , "bmaitner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Color palettes based on the named production colorways of the
    Glyos System Series toy line by Onell Design, with ggplot2 colour and fill
    scales for discrete and continuous data. Hex values are approximations
    curated from product photography and Onell Design's published color
    descriptions; rglyos is a fan project and is not affiliated with or
    endorsed by Onell Design.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports: 
    ggplot2,
    grDevices,
    graphics
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/bmaitner/rglyos
BugReports: https://github.com/bmaitner/rglyos/issues
